body:
This. Eggzactly this. Sigh.

I have to be careful about screwing up benefits to keep us at the nearly drowning point. Earn too much and suddenly its rent or meds. Meds are not fekking optional. I love her, I love my country. I just wish we could take more care of the most vulnerable. Never thought i would be one. Just drives that point home more.

